  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing and Strengthening People Organizations for the Fullfillment of Civil, Political, Economic, Social and Cultural Rights, phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">St&#xe4;rkung von Basisorganisationen zur Erf&#xfc;llung der zivilen, politischen, wirtschaftlichen, sozialen und kulturellen Rechte, 2. Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Das Projekt st&#xe4;rkt die F&#xe4;higkeit von Basisgruppen, ihre Interessen in Landrechtskonflikten zu vertreten und durch Lobby- und Advocacy-Arbeit negative Konsequenzen von Investitionsprojekten abzuwenden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project strengthens the capacity of grassroots groups to represent their interests in land rights conflicts and to avert negative consequences of investment projects through lobbying and advocacy work.</narrative>
  </description>
